{"id":"eef26124815f6232","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory.md","title":"Reflection Principle in Proof Theory","display":"thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory — Reflection Principle in Proof Theory","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory","aliases":["72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory"],"display":"thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory — Reflection Principle in Proof Theory","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]","[[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]","[[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Definition 10.3.4(1); printed p. 624; PDF p. 636; explicit local arithmetic representation and standard-truth correspondence; metalinguistic length cutoff retained","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"Local range-of-function argument; arithmetic sentence and standard-truth equivalence under explicit Rep; canonical bounded representations and internal reflection not established","previous_source_proof_status":"Direct range-of-function argument; external reflection only","round2_verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background","verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background","review_2026_10_23_book_recheck":"补构算术反映句、表示条件及标准真值对应；保留有界复杂度与内部可证性限制"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory — Reflection Principle in Proof Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b0118b1d3360ec7d\" href=\"?note=b0118b1d3360ec7d\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment\">72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2ce276183c963d6c\" href=\"?note=2ce276183c963d6c\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth\">72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Definition 10.3.4(1); printed p. 624; PDF p. 636; explicit local arithmetic representation and standard-truth correspondence; metalinguistic length cutoff retained"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Local range-of-function argument; arithmetic sentence and standard-truth equivalence under explicit Rep; canonical bounded representations and internal reflection not established"},{"key":"previous_source_proof_status","html":"Direct range-of-function argument; external reflection only"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},{"key":"review_2026_10_23_book_recheck","html":"补构算术反映句、表示条件及标准真值对应；保留有界复杂度与内部可证性限制"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(P:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}\">\\(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TAUT}\">\\(\\mathrm{TAUT}\\)</span> 及互逆编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wn}:\\Sigma^*\\to\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{wn}:\\Sigma^*\\to\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nw}:\\omega\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\operatorname{nw}:\\omega\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；只有在相应断言前件中才要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\">\\(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\">\\(\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RFN}_P(n)\">\\(\\operatorname{RFN}_P(n)\\)</span> 是外部元语言谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RFN}^{a}(D,U)\">\\(\\operatorname{RFN}^{a}(D,U)\\)</span> 则是下式构造的算术对象句，三者不作隐式同一化。</li>\n<li>算术公式树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_a\">\\(\\mathcal A_a\\)</span>、自由变量指标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_a\">\\(\\operatorname{fv}_a\\)</span>、闭句集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sent}_A\">\\(\\operatorname{Sent}_A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_a,\\forall_a\">\\(\\to_a,\\forall_a\\)</span> 及环境更新取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b0118b1d3360ec7d\" href=\"?note=b0118b1d3360ec7d\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment\">72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment</a>；标准真值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AT}\">\\(\\mathsf{AT}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2ce276183c963d6c\" href=\"?note=2ce276183c963d6c\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth\">72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,U\\in\\mathcal A_a\">\\(D,U\\in\\mathcal A_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_a(D)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{fv}_a(D)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_a(U)\\subseteq\\{1\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{fv}_a(U)\\subseteq\\{1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的第0、第1自由坐标依次表示证明串码与公式串码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的第1坐标表示公式串码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rep}_P(D,U)\">\\(\\operatorname{Rep}_P(D,U)\\)</span> 在下式中要求它们在全部标准数值上准确表示相应关系；这里只定义并使用该参数条件，不预设一对尚未构造的规范表示，也不预设任何算术理论证明反映句。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\;P(\\pi)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\;P(\\pi)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RFN}_P(n)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\bigl(|\\pi|\\leq n\\to P(\\pi)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RFN}_P(n)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\bigl(|\\pi|\\leq n\\to P(\\pi)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{RFN}_P(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{RFN}_P(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Rep}_P(D,U)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\xi\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ \\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\mathsf{AT}(D,\\xi)\\leftrightarrow P(\\operatorname{nw}(\\xi(0)))=\\operatorname{nw}(\\xi(1))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land\\bigl(\\mathsf{AT}(U,\\xi)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{nw}(\\xi(1))\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{RFN}^{a}(D,U)&amp;:=\\forall_a x_0\\forall_a x_1(D\\to_a U),\\\\\n\\operatorname{RFN}^{a}(D,U)&amp;\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_P(D,U)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(\\mathsf{AT}(\\operatorname{RFN}^{a}(D,U),\\eta)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\land\\operatorname{Rep}_P(D,U)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\mathsf{AT}(\\operatorname{RFN}^{a}(D,U),\\eta).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Rep}_P(D,U)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\xi\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ \\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\mathsf{AT}(D,\\xi)\\leftrightarrow P(\\operatorname{nw}(\\xi(0)))=\\operatorname{nw}(\\xi(1))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land\\bigl(\\mathsf{AT}(U,\\xi)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{nw}(\\xi(1))\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{RFN}^{a}(D,U)&amp;:=\\forall_a x_0\\forall_a x_1(D\\to_a U),\\\\\n\\operatorname{RFN}^{a}(D,U)&amp;\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_P(D,U)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(\\mathsf{AT}(\\operatorname{RFN}^{a}(D,U),\\eta)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\land\\operatorname{Rep}_P(D,U)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\mathsf{AT}(\\operatorname{RFN}^{a}(D,U),\\eta).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Chapter VIII，Definition 10.3.4(1)，印刷页 624，PDF 页 636 定义算术反映原则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall d,u((d:P\\vdash u)\\to\\operatorname{Taut}(u))\">\\(\\forall d,u((d:P\\vdash u)\\to\\operatorname{Taut}(u))\\)</span>；原有外部谓词给出可靠性及按证明串长截断的含义；本轮另补出对象算术句及其精确表示条件。</li>\n<li>原有外部可靠性式由 Cook–Reckhow 定义中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(P)=\\mathrm{TAUT}\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(P)=\\mathrm{TAUT}\\)</span> 直接推出，本次已经复核。不能据此外部真值推断弱算术理论证明了 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\">\\(\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>原有外部接口本身不含算术对象句；下方新补充采用明确的本册数值编码构造该句。原书的有界公式复杂度及 associated-theory 关系仍未在此形式化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2026-10-23 原书复核补充：印刷624/PDF636的 Definition 10.3.4(1) 实际构造算术句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall d,u((d:P\\vdash u)\\to\\operatorname{Taut}(u))\">\\(\\forall d,u((d:P\\vdash u)\\to\\operatorname{Taut}(u))\\)</span>；先前两个外部谓词本身没有给出这个对象。现直接在本册已有算术语法中构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RFN}^{a}(D,U)\">\\(\\operatorname{RFN}^{a}(D,U)\\)</span>，并把证明码/公式码的顺序及表示条件全部放入前两节。外部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\">\\(\\operatorname{RFN}(P)\\)</span> 名称继续保留给原有接口。</p>\n<p>闭句性由两项自由变量界及两次全称绑定直接得到。展开 AT 的全称、蕴涵子句并使用 Rep，得到对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\omega\">\\(m,k\\in\\omega\\)</span> 的条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(\\operatorname{nw}(m))=\\operatorname{nw}(k)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{nw}(k)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\">\\(P(\\operatorname{nw}(m))=\\operatorname{nw}(k)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{nw}(k)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\)</span>。外部可靠性立即推出它；反向对任意证明串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\operatorname{wn}(\\pi)\">\\(m=\\operatorname{wn}(\\pi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=\\operatorname{wn}(P(\\pi))\">\\(k=\\operatorname{wn}(P(\\pi))\\)</span>，由 wn/nw 互逆得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(\\pi)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\">\\(P(\\pi)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\)</span>。最后一式再用 Cook–Reckhow 的值域条件。因此新增对应有完整本地推导，不仅是两种句子的名称对应。</p>\n<p>这里采用基本算术公式的参数化表示。原书还为具体表示规定证明关系的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^b_1\">\\(\\Sigma^b_1\\)</span> 复杂度、Taut 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^b_1\">\\(\\Pi^b_1\\)</span> 复杂度及其弱理论内性质；本次没有构造那些规范表示或证明相应复杂度界。Rep 是标准模型中的表示条件，不能由它推出任何给定弱算术理论证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RFN}^{a}(D,U)\">\\(\\operatorname{RFN}^{a}(D,U)\\)</span>；也没有据此加入 Definition 10.3.4(2)–(3) 的模拟/关联理论定理。原有未完成范围保留；既有eligible资格只覆盖所明确陈述的局部推导，新增核验也仅覆盖带Rep条件的标准真值对应，不能扩张到那些未构造的表示或内部可证性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment","status":"resolved","id":"b0118b1d3360ec7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth","status":"resolved","id":"2ce276183c963d6c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$，$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}$、$\\mathrm{TAUT}$ 及互逆编码 $\\operatorname{wn}:\\Sigma^*\\to\\omega$、$\\operatorname{nw}:\\omega\\to\\Sigma^*$ 取 [[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]。$n\\in\\om