k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"P(\\operatorname{nw}(m))=\\operatorname{nw}(k)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{nw}(k)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"m=\\operatorname{wn}(\\pi)","display":false},{"tex":"k=\\operatorname{wn}(P(\\pi))","display":false},{"tex":"P(\\pi)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^b_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^b_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RFN}^{a}(D,U)","display":false}],"bytes":6132,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本轮内容修订：[[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory]]。"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本轮内容修订：[[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本轮内容修订：[[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory]]。"},{"id":"48e14346571b392f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原摘要列出的 3 个修订文件是 [[72-df-rule-admissibility]]、[[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] 和 [[72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory]]；摘要说明修订涉及合法规则标签域及算术反映句接口。它另声称复用了哈希吻合的既有全文记录。当前附件没有提供该历史哈希账本或原报告，本记录不把该声称升级为本次核验结果。"}],"outgoing":["d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","b0118b1d3360ec7d","2ce276183c963d6c"]}